id: pm-jira-0571
title: Restore a successful Hound review for Jira Cloud cursor PR #120
description: "At head 713d3c47a2e521e31c09c83375ab10b75aa622d9, Hound reports ERROR: We have encountered an error while reviewing your code. It supplies no finding or target URL. Node 22/26 and the full local 193-test release gate pass; this external review status still prevents a fully green rollup. Verify Hound recovery at the eventual exact head before merge; do not bypass its status or change application code to silence a service failure."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-03T00:28:31.529Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T12:14:37.467Z"
author: codex-sol-land
acceptance_criteria: Hound completes successfully on the current PR head without disabling the check.
resolution: "Unresolved: successful Hound acceptance of the merged PR head is not established."
expected_result: Keep successful exact-head Hound acceptance unresolved; distinguish the explicit maintainer decision to merge with the service error from a successful review.
actual_result: "PR #120 merged head 35e849a2d1522097a416d966b55d6ff3a74bdc1e as 21d52aec01033ba6ff75050032fe9348837b1cf0. GitHub records Hound ERROR on that head at 2026-10-04T10:46:36Z; earlier success at d7fc4661a172fc1446bc5f6744ddf9dca32dfbf0 at 09:13:01Z is historical. The maintainer explicitly merged despite the service error in issuecomment-5979159857; this is not successful exact-head acceptance."
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T09:14:52.797Z",pi-land-s2,"Resolved externally at rebased head d7fc466: Hound completed successfully on the new head ('Smells good to me. Woof!', 0 findings) together with Node 22/26 CI, Greptile/DeepScan and CodeQL. No code change was made for the service failure; the acceptance (successful Hound review on the current PR head) is met. Full exact-head gate: 193/193 tests, extension install, strict health, dist equality, and Bun install pass."
  "2026-10-21T19:05:23.452Z",codex-agent,"Tracker reconciliation authorized for the audited verdict FIXED-STALE. Re-verified unchanged main 01fb41c66251: delivery 21d52aec0103 remains in main ancestry; index.ts, test/cloud-search.test.ts remain present. Restore a successful Hound review for Jira Cloud cursor PR #120. The item records successful Hound acceptance at d7fc466 with zero findings; [PR #120](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/120) is now merged (21d52ae). Its explicit external-review requirement was met. Scope: tracker state only; no new runtime certification or deployment claim."
  "2026-10-22T12:10:20.008Z",codex-agent,"PR #154 review round: PRRT_kwDOSYpLFc6vB9_l is valid. Plan: append the correction without rewriting history, reopen this existing item, regenerate the changelog, correct the PR description, and run tracker-only gates. The service error at 713d3c4 predates the success at d7fc466; independently queried GitHub statuses establish another error at the actual merged head 35e849a. CodeRabbit latest review has one inline finding and no Outside diff range findings. Review threads and every comment were fetched completely (no next pages)."
  "2026-10-22T12:11:18.104Z",codex-agent,"CORRECTION superseding the 2026-10-21 closure: origin/main 01fb41c6625106f4f18f1927cd65367ef3dc374f leaves this item open, and delivery ancestry does not prove Hound acceptance. gh pr view 120 --json headRefOid,mergeCommit,statusCheckRollup binds the merged head to 35e849a and Hound ERROR. The commit status APIs independently show success at d7fc466 (09:13:01Z) and error at 35e849a (10:46:36Z), both 2026-10-04 UTC. Paginated PR comments include the explicit maintainer merge decision at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/pull/120#issuecomment-5979159857. Earlier service-error and success events remain historical; append-only history is preserved. Keep the original success criterion unresolved; no review service bypass or rerun is requested."
  "2026-10-22T12:12:18.706Z",codex-agent,"Tracker-only revert proof: the linked evidence assertion reads the item and live PR #120 head/merge/status data. Against original PR #154 head ef8aa9434808c599a9e2630f771b4cec1d1b22d1 (PM_JIRA_REVIEW_BASELINE=1), it exits 1, 0/1 pass, because the item is closed. Against the corrected item it passes 1/1 with no skips. The old item is read using git show; no tracker file or history was overwritten for the countercheck. Self-review covered all 21 original changed files: the other nine closure records retain delivered mainline code/workflow evidence and historical certification boundaries. The Hound changelog entry and PR summary are corrected as the other instances of this unsupported success claim."
  "2026-10-22T12:14:37.467Z",codex-agent,"Final validation: npm ci exit 0 (32 packages added, 73 audited, zero vulnerabilities); pm --no-extensions test pm-jira-0571 --run --progress passes 1/1, zero failures/skips/cancellations, and the original-item countercheck fails 0/1 as recorded. npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check exit 0. pm health --check-only --json exits 0 with 9/10 checks OK and the pre-existing extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew warning (pinned CLI 2026.10.15, extension host 2026.10.22); overall ok=false, so this is not a clean strict-health receipt. No dependency bump is included. npm run build and git diff --exit-code -- dist exit 0; all eight tracked dist artifacts are unchanged. All ten changed history streams preserve their mainline byte prefix and this item preserves its complete pre-review history prefix. git diff --check and added-line privacy scan pass. Tracker-only gates apply; no runtime suite count is claimed. Refetched main remains 01fb41c66251 and already included. Item remains open and released for orchestrator verification; exact-head successful Hound acceptance remains unresolved."
